PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
29-turn game. ChaseHon opened devastatingly: Lily's Strategy buffed the whole board +1000, and Cryolinx/Lyleen destroyed Faraway's Jormuntide and Elphidran in one turn despite a bare-form Foxparks interrupt (turn 1). Faraway's Pengullet/Lyleen/Reindrix chipped ChaseHon down early (10->6->4->2, several Lucky Pal cancels) while ChaseHon's Digtoise (buffed via Faraway's own Pump-Action Shotgun-adjacent tech and repeated turn buffs) traded through Faraway's Relaxaurus and Pengullet across turns 9-17, twice interrupted bare-form by Foxparks (turns 11, 17). ChaseHon's Elphidran/Pengullet explode-sacrifice plays wiped Faraway's board for 2200 and 1700 self-damage (turns 22, 28) while several of Faraway's attacks were nullified by ChaseHon's Dinossom/Reindrix/Cryolinx interrupts (turns 15, 21, 25, 27). ChaseHon's Elphidran Aqua and Digtoise closed it out turn 29 (5 to 3 to 0).


